  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEstimate the quotient, then check your estimate on your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e62.42 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18165\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/divide.gif\"\u003e 8.78\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind \"compatible numbers\" to round off to.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eIn this case, rather than trying to round to the nearest one or ten, we want to find two close numbers which are easy to divide.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e62.42 is close to 63, and 8.78 is close to 9. We know we can easily divide 63 by 9 – these are compatible numbers.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e62.42 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18166\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/divide.gif\"\u003e 8.78 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18167\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/approx.gif\"\u003e 63 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18168\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/divide.gif\"\u003e 9\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003d 7\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCheck using your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eCheck using your calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the value \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18169\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/approx.gif\"\u003e 7.109, pretty close to our estimate.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_5_1_rationalnumbers_6_40/f-40-6-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    }
  ]
